<title>FRANCE: Pechiney first quarter sales rise.</title>
<headline>Pechiney first quarter sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First three months of 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					17,027    vs   15,696</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p>    aluminium					5,174    vs    5,330</p>
<p>    packaging					5,607    vs    5,347</p>
<p>    various industrial activities		759    vs	838</p>
<p>    international trade			  5,487    vs    4,181</p>
<p>NOTE - Pechiney said in a statement sales had risen 8.5 percent versus the same period last year and by 11.4 percent versus the last quarter of 1996.</p>
</text>
